<title>USA: B&amp;H Ocean Carriers to buy Korean vessel.</title>
<headline>B&amp;H Ocean Carriers to buy Korean vessel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>B&amp;H Ocean Carriers Ltd said late on Wednesday it has entered a contract to buy a 35,910 DWT bulk carrier, built in Korea in 1977.</p>
<p>The company said delivery of the vessel, which has been chartered for about one year, is scheduled for mid-February.</p>
<p>The company said it will own and operate ten product tankers, two bulk carriers and have a 50 percent joint venture interest in a third bulk carrier after this acquisition.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
